# SUBJECTS WITH LOW AMPLITUDE TREMOR:
# REST TREMOR, 45 MINUTES AFTER DBS STOPPED (MEDICATION OFF) (n=8 files)
#------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUBJ   FILE         RANGE VELOCITY LASER  RATE SAMPLES
# g9     g9r45of.rit  0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6240
